{"version":1,"content":"<p>據知情人士透露，儘管英偉達周二宣佈無意讓被迫離職的行政總裁黃仁勳重返公司，但董事會內部仍有部分成員正在推動其回歸。知情人士稱，黃仁勳已與多名科技行業高管會面，並與至少一名董事會成員討論了自己重返公司的可能性。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587094.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:04:09.521918+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T06:50:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T06:57:15.727358+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T06:57:15.727358+00:00","content_hash":"d78abc76bc4675042dea4b259d0936b39e785d8baf6549701f49a20a0e9f07a2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}